Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.34,0:00:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps approaching]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA] An E-rank hunter\Ntaking a carrier job
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,in an A-rank dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.34,0:00:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he think he's invincible?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his motive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He did have a weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,when I caught him\Nin front of the boss room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going in the gate, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NUh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, did something\Nhappen in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA] No.\NIt's a personal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing for you to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales sharply]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but do you have any weapons\NI could borrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping for\Nsomething more traditional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a sword or a spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NYou know we're miners?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.14,0:00:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got shovels\Nand crowbars eh--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.93,0:00:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NNever mind, thanks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fight just fine unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NThink this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.35,0:01:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to\Ngo in empty handed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not be "traditional,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's better\Nthan nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-[CHA] Very well.\N-Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.61,0:01:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps receding]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[flag rustles]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[banging]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at 'em all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If this many high orcs\Never broke out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They would flatten\Na city or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Long before help could arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[GEONGUK]\NThose four in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're packin' more aura\Nthan the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON] It's our job\Nto close this gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to make sure\Nthe dungeon boss goes down,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.09,0:03:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NDo you fear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.39,0:03:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Pitiful humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.60,0:03:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[GINA]\NThis can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he have\Nso much magic power?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.19,0:03:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORA]\NCompared to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it's like\NI'm a third-rate spellcaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's being generous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.86,0:03:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[shudders]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we came to meet with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-[KARGALGAN] You entertain us.\N-[KIHOON] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NOne by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,tortured, and devoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sole purpose\Nof pleasing my soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[all gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Entertainment?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON] That's all this beast\Nthinks we're good for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even\Nsee us as enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're nothing\Nbut toys to be broken...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and tossed aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NOh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something strange\Nmixed with the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This may be more interesting\Nthan I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[all whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[breathes deeply]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kihoon screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NSong of Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clangs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.75,0:04:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.67,0:04:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NYou fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:04:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Antigravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:04:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kihoon groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NGravity Acceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.22,0:05:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]\N[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.93,0:05:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kihoon groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.27,0:05:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[Eunsoo breathes shakily]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kihoon.\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[crashes]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.73,0:05:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NCaptain Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hunters Guild has\Nthe rights to this dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really not my place, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But as it stands
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,your strike team\Nis in real danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let me ask you this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[crashes]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,do I have your permission...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,to kill every beast in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[breath trembles]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,By all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kargalgan scoffs]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.81,0:05:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NJust a copycat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and no more intimidating\Nthan a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.03,0:06:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[all gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NGotta hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the most intense aura\NI've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NNaturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NYou know, unfortunately
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a terrible matchup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[all gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NAnd when I say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[strains]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.43,0:06:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.89,0:06:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Surveillance Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[WORKER 1]\NWhat are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[WORKER 2]\NHow should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NSomeone call a supervisor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINCHUL] He's worked two days\Nas a miner for them,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but what's his angle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NHow can I help you gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINCHUL] We're looking for\Na hunter named Jinwoo Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NHe sure is popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I freakin' knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that dude was sketchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.58,0:06:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've seen\Nthe death glare he shot at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It was horrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I thought\NI was gonna die right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, is he still around?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.29,0:07:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NYes, but inside the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The carrier was a no-show,\Nso Sung stepped up to fill in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINCHUL]\NHe isn't fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NNo, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINCHUL]\NWent from mining the resources
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,to hauling the bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Being an S-rank means
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,everything he does\Nis subject to scrutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-I hope he realizes that.\N-[indistinct chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There something\NI should know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINCHUL]\NI'm sure all will be revealed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.77,0:07:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,on the news tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-[LEE] The news?\N-Hey, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Cha was\Nlooking for him, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.03,0:07:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but didn't say why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.65,0:07:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Cha was?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.49,0:07:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[all gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.07,0:07:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[SURVEILLANCE MEMBER]\NOh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That was one vicious aura!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[ASSOCIATE] Felt like it was\Ngonna tear me to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.25,0:07:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, go measure\Nthe gate's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-[SURVEILLANCE MEMBER]Yes, sir!\N-[ASSOCIATE] Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind gusting]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NI need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How Kihoon's team was able\Nto beat this many high orcs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and then keep pressing on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the blast of power\NI just sensed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,came from the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:07:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt\Nthey'll be as lucky again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NConfronting my massive army
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,with your measly troop?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You brainless fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look down on my guys,\Nit upsets me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Monarch's Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.83,0:08:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A skill exclusive\Nto my job class.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it after hitting level 70
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,in the Demon's Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Climbing the castle has made\Nmy soldiers stronger, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The E-rank\Nsummoned all of those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only manage two summons,\Nand that's on a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORA]\NHis power feels almost inhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.85,0:08:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NKill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[all roar]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.11,0:08:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[slices]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[slices]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[orcs groan]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:08:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[orcs groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[GEONGUK]\NYou see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like watching\Nthe vice guildmaster fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he carrying bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He could carry a strike team!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[slices]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Most of my men\Nare around B-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Each high orc's life
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.93,0:09:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,comes at the cost\Nof four or five of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.73,0:09:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll help thin the herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NSong of Dragon Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[Jinwoo gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN] You believed those\Nscarecrows could save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Such arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.49,0:09:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think you're one\Nto talk about arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause my "scarecrows"\Naren't done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NSong of Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Acceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[crashes]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NGravity Acceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[Jinwoo grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NAntigravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Acceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[crashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:09:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.77,0:10:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NYou have limits,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.93,0:10:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll kill your puppets\Nas many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Till your magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,is spent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Song of Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[all panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NHe's got a wellspring of mana
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to fuel his ranged,\Nmulti-target spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NI'm curious,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,how long will it take\Nbefore you crumble?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[beeps]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[SURVEILLANCE MEMBER]\NResults are in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out this gate\Nis a higher-end A-rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,almost approaching S!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The first read was wrong, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact the guild's leader\NASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of us\Nare going to head in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and provide the strike team\Nsome backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.23,0:10:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NR-right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NYou see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My soldiers are superior\Nin quantity and quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,before your magic power\Nis gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.61,0:10:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[smirks]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NThere you go again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:10:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,making assumptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[pops]\N[gulps]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.66,0:11:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NHeard of necromancers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how about I show you\None in action?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NTurning my soldiers into yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] They'll all become\Nmy shadows soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So will you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kargalgan growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[flag rustles]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NHow can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What purpose do I serve?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,When my eyes\Nfirst opened in this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,there was but a single thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,running through my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hunt...the humans."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason makes no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:12:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I need only heed the command.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[orcs growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.01,0:12:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.56,0:12:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Slaughter the intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.73,0:12:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And offer their carcasses\Nas a tribute to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUILD ASSOCIATE]\NOn par with an S-rank dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If the original measurement\Nhad been accurate,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.53,0:12:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Son's team could've\Ncleared that gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.49,0:12:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but we were caught off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.45,0:12:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreadfully so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUILD ASSOCIATE]\NA dungeon break could mean
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeju Island part two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NThankfully, we still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[elevator bell dings]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.87,0:12:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather our guild's\Nstrongest forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll head there without delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The emergency call has already
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,gone out\Nto the Vice Guildmaster
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and all of the A-ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Worst-case scenario,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.51,0:12:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we could ask the White Tigers\Nor even the Reapers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-if they could give us a hand.\N-[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, if we do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's avoid it, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanks]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[swords clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:12:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[orc groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[swords clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[orc roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanks]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.71,0:13:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[swords clanks]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[crashes]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like my generals\Nhave the upper hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NThat's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.31,0:13:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-[SEOKJIN] Right!\N-[GEONGUK] Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN] Song of High Fever!\NSong of Blindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.73,0:13:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[vomits]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN] The audience\Nshould not presume
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,to take the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And, truth be told...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had just about\Nenough of your insolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Song of Sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Song of Impediment!\NSong of Blindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty resistant\Nto curses and poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NSong of Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] All right, man,\NI'm gonna break that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,annoying shield of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[explodes]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[bones clatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.57,0:14:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kargalgan breathing heavily]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NWhat's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those being summoned here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many\Nof them though!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORA]\NVice Guildmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, could one of you tell me\Nwhat I'm looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[SEMI]\NHonestly, we're confused, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NHow dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Song of Rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Song of Strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Song of Giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Be crushed beneath my foot\Nlike the insect you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.44,0:14:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[stomps]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.57,0:15:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NGotta say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.94,0:15:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not too fond of giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.53,0:15:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That move kinda pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.99,0:15:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NSong of Dragon Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[explodes]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[orc groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NDo you still think I,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the mighty Kargalgan,\Nam no match for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NYep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] The bigger the target,\Nthe easier it is to hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.82,0:15:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NYou're a mage,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you thought\Nyou could fend off
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,an assassin's attack\Nwithout your shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.45,0:15:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NSong of Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[Jinwoo grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[explodes]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[Jinwoo grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.01,0:16:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.59,0:16:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If daggers aren't enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,let's try this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[chain clinking]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.81,0:16:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[chain jingling]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kargalgan panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kargalgan breathing heavily]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[Jinwoo grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[Jinwoo screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.91,0:16:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[breathes shakily]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NManager Woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Cha.\NYou're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.87,0:16:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We sensed a rather\Nalarming aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we rushed to help\Nas soon as we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems Hunter Sung\Nhad it under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NEven the Surveillance Team
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,is onto him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's clearly\Na top-class combat hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.93,0:16:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but he uses summoning magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.89,0:16:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.35,0:16:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who in the world\Nis that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.27,0:17:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it that\Nyou've met him before?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we are acquainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But only in passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kargalgan groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.03,0:17:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] The second your\Nbodyguards became mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You were as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NDo you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.79,0:17:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My body can't\Npossibly be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.21,0:17:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.59,0:17:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.22,0:17:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[breathes shakily]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.94,0:17:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NI won't touch their loot,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,even if I did solo the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.11,0:17:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt they'll mind me\Nextracting his shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.53,0:17:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[both gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to see becoming a shadow\Nchilled you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A name?\NAh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Gargle, something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.34,0:18:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,how about I call you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.18,0:18:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NI like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\N"Elite Knight Rank?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense for an A-rank\Ndungeon boss, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.31,0:18:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,These high orc guys\Nare pretty epic too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.23,0:18:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NManager Woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.03,0:18:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was too focused\Non collecting shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.74,0:18:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,to notice him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.07,0:18:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[GEONGUK]\NMy man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[SEMI] What was all that?\NAren't you a carrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NI, well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NWhat do I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.62,0:18:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINCHUL]\NThat's classified information.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All matters\Nregarding Hunter Sung
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,have been deemed top secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's our job\Nto enforce that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why I need everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep what happened today\Nconfidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.01,0:18:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be escorting you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.93,0:19:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really the best way\Nto avoid
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,having any more\Nattention on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NHmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.19,0:19:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINCHUL]\NI won't downplay the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,that he has S-rank abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you all saw that\Nwith your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's my hope\Nyou'll make his exit quiet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,in gratitude for your rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.45,0:19:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps receding]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minute, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have your reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,for concealing\Nyour real strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And, of course,\Nwe have no right
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to make you explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even gonna ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,what made you take\Nthe carrier job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Point is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,a lot of lives\Ncould have been lost
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but instead,\Nwe're all walking out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As captain of this team,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!\NThat's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.65,0:19:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You want this back, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.32,0:19:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINCHUL] If you're finished,\Nlet's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps receding]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-[gasps]\N-Um. Miss Cha?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Bora?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORA] I was just wondering\Nwhy you have a pickax?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I looked like\Na weirdo to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORA]\NBy "him" you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.67,0:20:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NNever mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.13,0:20:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You can forget I asked that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.47,0:20:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NIt's a relief that everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,made it out safely in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.93,0:20:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But how odd,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung was there\Nfor the White Tigers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and their red gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and then he came\Nto our rescue as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,His speed is comparable\Nto an assassin type's,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,he can raise the dead at will,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.11,0:20:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,then add them\Nto his vast army of summons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.03,0:20:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all a little hard\Nto believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.53,0:20:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,In your honest,\Nunbiased opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,how does Hunter Sung\Ncompare to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.41,0:20:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON]\NHunters of different types
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,work together during raids,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,pooling their strength\Nto compensate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,for individual weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's standard\Noperating procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:20:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could clear
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,a higher-end A-rank dungeon\Nby yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.39,0:21:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No tanks, no healers,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.97,0:21:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NNo, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.77,0:21:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Which frankly\Nis rather embarrassing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,considering all the talk of me\Nbeing the "ultimate weapon."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.69,0:21:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Guildmaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.73,0:21:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NI know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON]\NWe need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NI'll do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps receding]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.49,0:21:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-[JINHO] Yo, bro!\N-Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.21,0:21:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.79,0:21:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NSorry, it took me so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.38,0:21:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how'd the guildmaster\Nstuff go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You work things out\Nwith your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINHO]\NFunny you mention that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.93,0:21:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.01,0:21:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to\Nrun something by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.72,0:21:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm reporting live
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.68,0:21:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-from the Hunter's Association.\N-[MINSUNG] Ah, I'm loving this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A flock of people\Nwho swooped in just to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.27,0:21:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"Minsung Lee,\Nthe man who has it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.65,0:21:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,has even acquired powers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,that transcend\Nthe human condition."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:21:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\N[inhales deeply]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.53,0:22:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.49,0:22:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
